- [ ] Uses correct uni-app template tags (`<view>`, `<text>`, `<image>`)
- [ ] Proper TypeScript types defined
- [ ] Loading states implemented with `uni.showLoading()`
- [ ] Error handling properly implemented
- [ ] ⚠️ **Uses promisified uni APIs** from `/src/utils/promisify.ts` (not direct callbacks)
- [ ] Permission checks implemented when needed
- [ ] TailwindCSS utility classes used appropriately
- [ ] ⚠️ **Uses rpx units (not px)** - viewport is always 750rpx
- [ ] ⚠️ **Design converted correctly** - 375px design × 2, 750px design directly
- [ ] Chinese text for user-facing strings
- [ ] Page registered in `pages.json`
- [ ] ⚠️ **New pages added to END of pages array** (not at position 0)
- [ ] Navigation uses uni API (`uni.navigateTo()`, etc.)
- [ ] No console.log in production code
- [ ] Path aliases used correctly (@/ for src)
- [ ] Platform-specific code uses conditional compilation when needed

## uni-app Best Practices

1. **Use promisified uni APIs instead of callbacks**
   - ✅ Import from `/src/utils/promisify.ts` (showToastAsync, showModalAsync, etc.)
   - ❌ Don't use uni APIs with callback functions
   - ✅ Add to promisify.ts if API not available

2. **Use uni API instead of Web API**
   - ❌ `fetch()`, `XMLHttpRequest`
   - ✅ Configured axios with uni-app adapter
   - ❌ `localStorage`
   - ✅ `getStorageAsync()`, `setStorageAsync()` from promisify.ts

3. **Use rpx units for responsive design**
   - ❌ `width: 200px`
   - ✅ `w-[200rpx]` (viewport is always 750rpx)
   - ✅ Convert Figma: 375px design × 2, 750px design directly

4. **Follow uni-app component lifecycle**
   - Use `onLoad` for page initialization
   - Use `onShow` for page display (runs every time)
   - Use `onHide` for cleanup or save state

5. **Use Pinia for global state**
   - Persist important state (token, user info)
   - Use setup store syntax (not options)
   - Export store using `useXxxStore` naming

6. **Optimize performance**
   - Use `v-if` for conditional rendering
   - Lazy load images with `lazy-load` attribute
   - Avoid deep nesting in templates
